  "description": "A woman has spent years being tormented by an obsessive stalker, leaving her emotionally exhausted and desperate. One day, while working at a convenience store, she notices a handsome but dangerous-looking man and comes up with a reckless idea: ask him to get rid of the stalker for her. Instead of being shocked by her request, the man becomes interested in her. What begins as a desperate attempt to escape one dangerous man may only draw her into the orbit of another.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002906)",
